---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Disclaimer" description="Negative Split Research is analysis and opinion, not investment advice.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[44rem] px-5 pt-14 sm:px-8 sm:pt-20">
    <p class="kicker">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="prose-nsr mt-8">
      <h2>Analysis and opinion only</h2>
      <p>
        Everything published by Negative Split Research, on this website, in the newsletter and on social media, is analysis and opinion for information and education only. It is not an offer, solicitation or recommendation to buy, sell or hold any security or financial instrument.
      </p>
      <h2>Not personalised investment advice</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing here takes into account your objectives, financial situation or needs. The author is not acting as your financial adviser, and no adviser–client relationship is created by reading or subscribing. Before making any investment decision, consider seeking advice from a suitably qualified and regulated professional.
      </p>
      <h2>Positions and disclosure</h2>
      <p>
        The author may hold positions in companies discussed. Any position held at the time of writing in a company covered in an issue will be disclosed in that issue. Positions may change after publication without notice.
      </p>
      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        Figures are drawn from public sources believed to be reliable, chiefly company filings, results presentations and earnings calls, and are cited where used. They may nonetheless contain errors or become out of date. Forecasts and scenarios are illustrative, not predictions. Past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results.
      </p>
      <h2>Do your own research</h2>
      <p>
        Investing involves risk, including the loss of capital. Verify anything you read here against original sources and do your own research before acting on it. You are solely responsible for your own investment decisions.
      </p>
      <h2>No affiliation</h2>
      <p>
        Negative Split Research is independent and is not affiliated with, endorsed by or paid by any company discussed unless explicitly stated. Company names and trademarks belong to their respective owners.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
